    "Scan of the 1966 edition of the Saint Bernice, Indiana, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1950; aerial photographs from 1964; field checked in 1966; photo inspected in 1977; last revised in 1966; printed in 1983.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
